msgstr "Her satıra bir yol, WordPress kök klasörüne göre. * joker karakteri kullanılabilir."

msgid "Always excluded: the backup folder, wp-snapshots, other backup plugins' folders (ai1wm-backups, updraft, wpvividbackups, backups-dup-*), cache, litespeed, upgrade, upgrade-temp-backup."
msgstr "Her zaman hariç: yedek klasörü, wp-snapshots, diğer yedek eklentilerinin klasörleri (ai1wm-backups, updraft, wpvividbackups, backups-dup-*), cache, litespeed, upgrade, upgrade-temp-backup."

